# Build output and generated bundles
/dist/
/build/

# Local environment and machine-specific configuration
.env
.env.*
*.local.toml

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#
#   docs/handoff/   — the method's axiom is that context not in the repository
#                     does not exist. An ignored handoff is a resume aid that
#                     fails in exactly the case it was written for: a fresh
#                     session on another machine. It is deleted at step 8
#                     instead, so nothing accumulates.
#                     See docs/handoff/README.md.
#
#   the secrets map — committed and valueless, holding paths rather than values.
#                     Ignoring it would mean nobody can tell what an environment
#                     needs without access to the store.
